# Report 030 (c-1), decision C4: hardware a board profile expects but that is not set up gets a read-only Info row with
# the reason instead of its row (only when board.conf names it; c-2 writes these hints for the HackBerry). No backlight
# device and HDMI only, with APPLAUNCH_HINT_BACKLIGHT=button and APPLAUNCH_HINT_SOUND=bluetooth:<speaker>: the root
# menu has "Speaker: pair ... in Bluetooth" after Screen, Screen has "Brightness: use the button on the case" before
# DarkTime. A release build. Review only: no golden.
title settings capability hints
review
sizes 720x720 480x320 640x480
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env APPLAUNCH_HINT_BACKLIGHT button
env APPLAUNCH_HINT_SOUND bluetooth:XWF-M18-M28-M38
@480x320 env APPLAUNCH_BACKLIGHT none
backlight none
sound hdmi
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
launch Settings
wait 300
expect_rows Screen "Speaker: pair XWF-M18-M28-M38 in Bluetooth" Wi-Fi Bluetooth Launcher Touch Apps User "Date & Time" System
shot settings_hints_root
key ENTER
wait 300
expect_rows "Brightness: use the button on the case" DarkTime
shot settings_hints_screen
